LakeOfRage_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "The GYARADOS are angry!\n"
	.string "It’s a bad omen!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lass::
	.string "Did my eyes deceive me? I saw a\n"
	.string "red GYARADOS in the LAKE...\p"
	.string "But I thought GYARADOS were\n"
	.string "usually blue?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_PokeManiac::
	.string "I heard this lake was made by\n"
	.string "rampaging GYARADOS.\p"
	.string "I wonder if there is any connection\n"
	.string "to their mass outbreak now?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanRaymondIntro::
	.string "No matter what I do, all I catch\n"
	.string "are the same POKéMON...$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanRaymondDefeat::
	.string "My line’s all tangled up...$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanRaymond::
	.string "Why can’t I catch any good POKéMON?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanAndreIntro::
	.string "Let me battle with the POKéMON I\n"
	.string "just caught!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanAndreDefeat::
	.string "I might be an expert angler, but\n"
	.string "I stink as a POKéMON trainer…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_FishermanAndre::
	.string "I won’t lose as an angler! I catch\n"
	.string "POKéMON all day.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerLoisIntro::
	.string "What happened to the red GYARADOS?\p"
	.string "It’s gone?\p"
	.string "Oh, darn. I came here for nothing?\p"
	.string "I know--let’s battle!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerLoisDefeat::
	.string "Good going!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerLois::
	.string "Come to think of it, I’ve seen a\n"
	.string "pink BUTTERFREE.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerAaronIntro::
	.string "If a trainer spots another trainer,\n"
	.string "he has to make a challenge.\p"
	.string "That is our destiny.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerAaronDefeat::
	.string "Whew...\n"
	.string "Good battle.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_CooltrainerAaron::
	.string "POKéMON and their trainer become\n"
	.string "powerful through constant battling.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lance_1::
	.string "This lake is full of GYARADOS but\n"
	.string "nothing else...\p"
	.string "So the MAGIKARP are being forced\n"
	.string "to evolve...$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lance_2::
	.string "Did you come here because of the\n"
	.string "rumors?\p"
	.string "You’re {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "I’m LANCE, a trainer like you.\p"
	.string "I heard some rumors, so I came to\n"
	.string "investigate...\p"
	.string "I saw the way you battled earlier,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "I can tell that you’re a trainer\n"
	.string "with considerable skill.\p"
	.string "If you don’t mind, could you help me\n"
	.string "investigate?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lance_3::
	.string "Oh... Well, if you change your mind,\n"
	.string "please help me.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lance_4::
	.string "LANCE: Hm? Are you going to help me?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Lance_5::
	.string "LANCE: Excellent!\p"
	.string "It seems that the LAKE’s MAGIKARP\n"
	.string "are being forced to evolve.\p"
	.string "A mysterious radio broadcast coming\n"
	.string "from MAHOGANY is the cause.\p"
	.string "I’ll be waiting for you, {PLAYER}.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "WESLEY: Well, how do you do?\p"
	.string "Seeing as how it’s Wednesday today,\n"
	.string "I’m WESLEY of Wednesday.\p"
	.string "Pleased to meet you. Please take a\n"
	.string "souvenir.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Boy_2::
	.string "WESLEY: BLACKBELT beefs up the\n"
	.string "power of fighting moves.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Boy_3::
	.string "WESLEY: Since you found me, you must\n"
	.string "have met my brothers and sisters.\l"
	.string "Or did you just get lucky?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "RINA: LAKE OF RAGE is so pretty…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "DANTE: Hah! I knew it!\n"
	.string "This is the perfect spot!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "RINA: Even though it’s raining, again…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "DANTE: ...$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "RINA: Don’t look so down,\n"
	.string "sweetie-pie…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "RINA: Wha-What is that?$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "RINA: Kyaaaah! It’s a GYARADOS!!!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "DANTE: Wow, it seems to be mad about\n"
	.string "something…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "RINA: Darling, I’m scared…!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "DANTE: Oh, well…\n"
	.string "Seems like I failed again…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "DANTE: Oh, hello {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Never thought to find you here!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_12::
	.string "RINA: Darling…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_13::
	.string "DANTE: Oh, yes. We are in a hurry\n"
	.string "now. We’ll see you later!$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Trigger1_14::
	.string "RINA: See you… later…$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Sign1::
	.string "FISHING GURU’S HOUSE$"

LakeOfRage_Text_Sign2::
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE, also known as\n"
	.string "GYARADOS LAKE.$"
